  "card": "This PR moves SQLite wallet transaction storage from generic key-value records into a dedicated relational table with columns for each transaction attribute. Storing transactions in their own table guarantees sequential loading by wallet position order via SQL queries, simplifying transaction state reconstruction and UTXO tracking. This change unblocks downstream improvements such as tracking no-longer-spendable TXOs in #27865. It depends on #32895 for feature-flagged database upgrades and #33033 for SQLite statement management.",
